builtin.body:
Use the built-in dictionaries for the Ocean-managed DSH runtime with this profile?
{profile}

DSH recreates generated cordis.yml and may save the language entry there. This feature does not download or install an add-on or change package.json, lockfiles, user patches, locale preferences or credentials. Normal DSH startup behavior is unchanged. Attached runtimes are not modified.

