verification.summary:
Snapshot structure and checksums passed

Profile: {profile}
Created (metadata, not authenticated): {created}
Files: {files}
Directories: {directories}
Configuration bytes: {bytes}

Scope: profile configuration only; best-effort snapshot consistency. Global credential/session/storage stores outside this profile are not included; .git and node_modules are excluded. Profile-local files may themselves contain secrets or databases.

Checksums are not signatures or publisher authentication. This is a point-in-time read, not an immutable snapshot or data-schema rollback.

No restore, snapshot/profile modification, service operation or package installation was performed. Restore remains an explicit offline CLI operation; stop all writers independently. This screen has only Close.

