{notice}

No restore or service operation is running from this screen. Counts are not success/authenticity confirmation.

export.confirm:
Export this {scope} into one archive?

Files: {files}
Bytes: {bytes}

The snapshot is verified before exporting, the archive is written once and never overwrites an existing file, and the snapshot itself is not modified. The export is reproducible: the same snapshot always produces the same bytes.

The archive is NOT signed. It proves integrity against its own manifest, not who created it, and it can contain conversation content or credentials, so store it as privately as the backup folder.

