This downloads the signed runtime bundle, verifies it, stops the local server, takes a full private (unencrypted) backup of your DSH home — credentials, configuration, plugins and sessions — and activates the new runtime. The server and its WebSocket clients will restart. Close all other DSH CLI/TUI writers first.

